title: "slf-core: a reference implementation of Substrate-Lens-Frame (SLF)"
abstract: "A standalone Apache-2.0 reference implementation of Substrate-Lens-Frame, a governance layer for agent memory: did:key and Ed25519 signing, a four-step gate engine, hash-chained payload-free receipts, crypto-erasure, and an executable conformance suite."
